<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Foreigners lift 97 SAfrica bond buys to 12bln rand.</title>
<headline>Foreigners lift 97 SAfrica bond buys to 12bln rand.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Foreigners were net buyers of South African bonds once again last week, lifting year-to-date purchases to nearly 12 billion rand, latest Bond Exchange of South Africa figures show.</p>
<p>Non-resident transactions (million rand):</p>
<p>				     Week to May 9     Year to date</p>
<p>    - purchases		   8,335.63	   127,737.92</p>
<p>    - sales			 7,097.89	   115,952.94</p>
<p>    - net purchases (sales)   1,237.73	    11,784.98</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
